{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317510/extras/Wishlist.gif?t=1745217922\" />  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to SokobotS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SokobotS is a cooperative sokoban game with goofy robots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover Sokobots:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play <strong>solo</strong> or in <strong>coop</strong> with different robots!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resolve <strong>sokoban puzzles</strong> with many interactions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control different robots with many <strong>abilities</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interact</strong> with <strong>other  rooms</strong> to help each others!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the plan of the evil Chococorp compagny...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a (very) unique story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the future, all industries are controled by a <strong>chocolate cereal lobby</strong> called Chococorp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When scientist discover that an asteroid belt with <strong>the most sugary chocolate ever</strong> is close to earth, Chococorp send robots to extract as many chocolate as possible. No matter what it cost...</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"ZapZapZap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3317510/eeb512a6b2339b82ffff8e836bbdfb1c27af78c6.jpg"},{"name":"Sticky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3317510/8ccb75cb1db5c1f11f2af4096a77fc3d39532652.jpg"},{"name":"Ender box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3317510/82112b2bac0f173d70146279537519756eb9bac2.jpg"},{"name":"Fashion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/im